extends ../disenos/principal.pug

block contenido

  //- Navigation
  nav(class="border-b border-[#E2DDD5] bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50 px-6 py-4")
    div(class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between")
      a(href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1A1614]")
        div(class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center")
          svg(class="w-4.5 h-4.5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z")
        span SubastasPro

      div(class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-[#8A7F76]")
        a(href="/#inicio" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Inicio
        a(href="/#como-funciona" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Cómo Funciona
        a(href="/#subastas-destacadas" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Subastas Destacadas
        a(href="/#caracteristicas" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Características

      div(class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm")
        a(href="/login" class="font-medium text-[#3D3530] hover:text-[#1A1614] px-3 py-2 transition-colors") Iniciar Sesión
        a(href="/registro" class="bg-[#D97706] hover:bg-[#B45309] text-white font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-[10px] transition-all shadow-btn") Registrarse

  //- Hero Section
  section#inicio(class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center")
    div(class="space-y-6 anim-fade-up")
      div(class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ECFDF5] border border-[#A7F3D0] text-[#065F46] text-xs font-semibold")
        span(class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#059669] dot-live")
        span Subastas en vivo ahora mismo

      h1(class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#1A1614]")
        | Puja y gana en 
        span(class="text-[#D97706]") tiempo real
        |  sin interrupciones

      p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl")
        | SubastasPro usa un temporizador inteligente por inactividad: la subasta se mantiene abierta mientras haya pujas y cierra automáticamente cuando nadie supera la oferta. Justo, transparente y emocionante.

      div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2")
        a(href="/#subastas-destacadas" class="bg-[#D97706] hover:bg-[#B45309] text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-[10px] flex items-center gap-2 transition-all shadow-btn")
          span Explorar Subastas
          svg(class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3")
        a(href="/registro" class="bg-white hover:bg-[#EFECE6] text-[#1A1614] font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-[10px] border border-[#E2DDD5] transition-all")
          | Crear Cuenta

      div(class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 pt-6 border-t border-[#E2DDD5] text-xs text-[#8A7F76]")
        div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
          svg(class="w-4 h-4 text-[#D97706]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z")
          span Cierre por inactividad
        div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
          svg(class="w-4 h-4 text-[#D97706]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z")
          span Vendedores verificados
        div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
          svg(class="w-4 h-4 text-[#D97706]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z")
          span Notificaciones en vivo

    div(class="relative rounded-[16px] overflow-hidden bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] shadow-card-hover anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-2")
      img(src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589829545856-d10d557cf95f?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Vista previa subasta" class="w-full h-[420px] object-cover")
      div(class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1A1614]/90 via-[#1A1614]/60 to-transparent p-6 flex justify-between items-end")
        div
          p(class="text-xs text-white/70 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium") Puja actual
          p(class="text-2xl font-bold text-white") $3,450
        div(class="text-right")
          p(class="text-xs text-white/70 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium") Cierra en
          p(class="text-xl font-mono font-bold text-[#FCA5A5]") 03:45

  //- How it Works
  section#como-funciona(class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 border-t border-[#E2DDD5]")
    div(class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3")
      p(class="text-[#D97706] font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest") CÓMO FUNCIONA
      h2(class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1614]") Cuatro pasos para empezar a ganar
      p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-sm") Diseñado para ser justo y adictivo. Sin sorpresas ni cierres abruptos: solo pujas hasta que ganes.

    div(class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6")
      div(class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] relative card-interactive shadow-card anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-1")
        div(class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FFFBEB] border border-[#FDE68A] text-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center mb-6")
          svg(class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z")
        span(class="absolute top-6 right-6 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#EBE5DC] select-none") 1
        h3(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614] mb-2") Regístrate
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-xs leading-relaxed") Crea tu cuenta gratis en segundos y verifica tu perfil para empezar a participar.

      div(class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] relative card-interactive shadow-card anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-2")
        div(class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FFFBEB] border border-[#FDE68A] text-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center mb-6")
          svg(class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10")
        span(class="absolute top-6 right-6 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#EBE5DC] select-none") 2
        h3(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614] mb-2") Elige o publica
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-xs leading-relaxed") Explora subastas activas o publica la tuya. Los administradores aprueban cada artículo.

      div(class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] relative card-interactive shadow-card anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-3")
        div(class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FFFBEB] border border-[#FDE68A] text-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center mb-6")
          svg(class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z")
        span(class="absolute top-6 right-6 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#EBE5DC] select-none") 3
        h3(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614] mb-2") Puja en tiempo real
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-xs leading-relaxed") Compite en vivo con la regla de inactividad: si nadie supera tu puja, la subasta cierra.

      div(class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] relative card-interactive shadow-card anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-4")
        div(class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FFFBEB] border border-[#FDE68A] text-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center mb-6")
          svg(class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z")
        span(class="absolute top-6 right-6 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#EBE5DC] select-none") 4
        h3(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614] mb-2") ¡Gana el último postor!
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-xs leading-relaxed") El último en pujar antes del cierre se lleva el artículo. Simple y transparente.

  //- Featured Auctions
  section#subastas-destacadas(class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 border-t border-[#E2DDD5]")
    div(class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12 gap-4")
      div(class="space-y-2")
        p(class="text-[#D97706] font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest") SUBASTAS DESTACADAS
        h2(class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1614]") Pujas calientes ahora mismo
      a(href="#" class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#8A7F76] hover:text-[#D97706] flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors")
        span Ver todas
        svg(class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
          path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3")

    div(class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6")
      if subastasDestacadas && subastasDestacadas.length
        each subasta, index in subastasDestacadas
          a(href=`/subastas/${subasta.id}` class="block group")
            div(class=`bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] rounded-[16px] overflow-hidden card-interactive shadow-card anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-${index + 1}`)
              div(class="relative h-56 overflow-hidden")
                if subasta.imagen_url
                  img(src=subasta.imagen_url alt=subasta.titulo class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500")
                else
                  div(class="w-full h-full bg-[#EFECE6] flex items-center justify-center")
                    svg(class="w-16 h-16 text-[#E2DDD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24")
                      path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z")
                span(class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#FFF7ED]/95 backdrop-blur text-[#C2410C] text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#FFEDD5]")= subasta.categoria
                - const estEfectivo = subasta.estadoEfectivo || subasta.estado
                if estEfectivo === 'activa'
                  span(class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-[#059669] text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-md badge-live")
                    span(class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white dot-live")
                    span EN VIVO
                else if estEfectivo === 'programada'
                  span(class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-md")
                    svg(class="w-3 h-3 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
                      path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z")
                    span PROGRAMADA
                else if estEfectivo === 'pendiente'
                  span(class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-[#FFFBEB] text-[#92400E] border border-[#FDE68A] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-md")
                    svg(class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
                      path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z")
                    span PENDIENTE
                else if estEfectivo === 'finalizada'
                  span(class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-[#EFECE6] text-[#8A7F76] border border-[#E2DDD5] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-md")
                    svg(class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
                      path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z")
                    span FINALIZADA
              div(class="p-5 space-y-4")
                h3(class="font-bold text-lg text-[#1A1614] group-hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors")= subasta.titulo
                div(class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#8A7F76] bg-[#F7F4EF] p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#EBE5DC]")
                  div
                    p Oferta actual
                    p(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#D97706]") $#{subasta.precio_actual}
                  div(class="text-right")
                    p(class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#8A7F76]") por
                    p(class="text-sm font-medium text-[#1A1614]")= subasta.vendedor
                div(class="w-full bg-[#D97706] hover:bg-[#B45309] text-white font-bold py-2.5 rounded-[10px] transition-all shadow-btn text-center text-sm")
                  | Ver Subasta
      else
        div(class="col-span-3 text-center py-12 text-[#8A7F76]")
          p No hay subastas activas por el momento.

  //- Features
  section#caracteristicas(class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 border-t border-[#E2DDD5]")
    div(class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3")
      p(class="text-[#D97706] font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest") CARACTERÍSTICAS PRINCIPALES
      h2(class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1614]") Tecnología pensada para pujas justas

    div(class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6")
      div(class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] card-interactive shadow-card space-y-4 anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-1")
        div(class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FFFBEB] border border-[#FDE68A] text-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center")
          svg(class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z")
        h3(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614]") Regla de inactividad
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-xs leading-relaxed") Si nadie puja durante el tiempo establecido, la subasta se cierra automáticamente. Nada de cierres injustos: mientras haya interés, la puja sigue viva.

      div(class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] card-interactive shadow-card space-y-4 anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-2")
        div(class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FFFBEB] border border-[#FDE68A] text-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center")
          svg(class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z")
        h3(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614]") Aprobación de administradores
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-xs leading-relaxed") Cada artículo publicado es revisado y aprobado por nuestro equipo antes de salir en vivo, garantizando calidad y confianza en cada subasta.

      div(class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] card-interactive shadow-card space-y-4 anim-fade-up anim-fade-up-3")
        div(class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FFFBEB] border border-[#FDE68A] text-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center")
          svg(class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75")
            path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9")
        h3(class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614]") Notificaciones en vivo
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] text-xs leading-relaxed") Recibe alertas instantáneas cuando alguien supera tu puja o cuando una subasta está por cerrar. Nunca pierdas el momento decisivo.

  //- Footer
  footer(class="border-t border-[#E2DDD5] bg-[#EFECE6] py-16 text-xs text-[#8A7F76]")
    div(class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10")
      div(class="space-y-4")
        div(class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1614]")
          div(class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-[#D97706] flex items-center justify-center")
            svg(class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2")
              path(stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z")
          span SubastasPro
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76] leading-relaxed") La plataforma de subastas en tiempo real con temporizador inteligente por inactividad. Puja, gana y vende con confianza.

      div(class="space-y-3")
        h4(class="font-semibold text-[#1A1614] uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]") Enlaces rápidos
        ul(class="space-y-2")
          li: a(href="/#subastas-destacadas" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Explorar Subastas
          li: a(href="/registro" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Publicar Subasta
          li: a(href="/#como-funciona" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Cómo Funciona
          li: a(href="/login" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Iniciar Sesión

      div(class="space-y-3")
        h4(class="font-semibold text-[#1A1614] uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]") Legal
        ul(class="space-y-2")
          li: a(href="#" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Términos y Condiciones
          li: a(href="#" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Política de Privacidad
          li: a(href="#" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Centro de Ayuda
          li: a(href="#" class="hover:text-[#D97706] transition-colors") Contacto

      div(class="space-y-3")
        h4(class="font-semibold text-[#1A1614] uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]") Mantente al día
        p(class="text-[#8A7F76]") Recibe las mejores subastas directo en tu correo.
        form(class="flex gap-2" onsubmit="return false;")
          input(type="email" placeholder="tu@correo.com" class="bg-white border border-[#E2DDD5] rounded-[10px] px-3 py-2 text-[#1A1614] w-full focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D97706] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FDE68A] text-sm placeholder-[#ADA69E]")
          button(type="submit" class="bg-[#D97706] hover:bg-[#B45309] text-white font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-[10px] transition-colors text-sm") Suscribir

    div(class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#E2DDD5] flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-[#ADA69E]")
      p © 2026 SubastasPro. Todos los derechos reservados.
      p Hecho con pasión por las subastas.